WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.651
Ben: I'm glad we met at the playground.

2
00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:21.664
Theo: Frankie likes the slide!

3
00:00:21.665 --> 00:00:32.030
Riley: Snooks is climbing up the wrong way! No, Snooks!

4
00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.931
Skyler: Here comes Sarah.

5
00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:36.586
And she's running!

6
00:00:36.587 --> 00:00:38.496
Sarah: Guess what!

7
00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:40.694
Riley: What?

8
00:00:40.695 --> 00:00:44.180
Sarah: There's a magic show today in the park.

9
00:00:44.181 --> 00:00:47.125
And my mom will take us!

10
00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:50.558
Skyler: I love magic shows!

11
00:00:50.559 --> 00:00:53.073
Theo: I have a magic kit.

12
00:00:53.074 --> 00:00:55.854
I tried to make Whiskers disappear.

13
00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.897
Theo: But it didn't work.

14
00:00:58.898 --> 00:01:07.799
Riley: That's okay. Whiskers disappears all the time anyway.

15
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.462
Sarah: We're going to see a real magician.

16
00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:13.510
Skyler: Can he cut people in half?

17
00:01:13.511 --> 00:01:17.382
I saw a magician do that once.

18
00:01:17.383 --> 00:01:21.664
Sarah: He cut someone in half?

19
00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:23.261
Skyler: Well, not really.

20
00:01:23.262 --> 00:01:25.940
It was just a trick.

21
00:01:25.941 --> 00:01:29.116
Riley: I'll go ask my mom if I can go.

22
00:01:29.117 --> 00:01:31.241
Theo, Ben, and Skyler: Me too.

23
00:01:31.242 --> 00:01:39.853
Riley: See you later, Sarah!

24
00:01:39.854 --> 00:01:43.974
Ben: We're lucky. We got front row seats!

25
00:01:43.975 --> 00:01:47.924
Skyler: The show is starting!

26
00:01:47.925 --> 00:01:51.400
Magician: Good afternoon, everyone!

27
00:01:51.401 --> 00:01:56.689
I am going to do a very special trick.

28
00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:59.491
Magician: I will need someone to help me.

29
00:01:59.492 --> 00:02:02.525
Who wants to come up on stage?

30
00:02:02.526 --> 00:02:06.518
Kids: Me, me, me!

31
00:02:06.519 --> 00:02:12.565
Magician: The little girl in the front row.

32
00:02:12.566 --> 00:02:15.302
Sarah: Who, me?

33
00:02:15.303 --> 00:02:18.417
Magician: Yes, step right up!

34
00:02:18.418 --> 00:02:20.343
Riley: Go on, Sarah.

35
00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:24.054
It will be fun!

36
00:02:24.055 --> 00:02:26.653
Sarah: Can I bring my cat, Mittens?

37
00:02:26.654 --> 00:02:35.569
Magician: Yes. I will do a daring trick with Mittens!
